OL,3,GNEWSAShops evacuated after potential
OL,4,Agas leak reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FShops were evacuated and multiple roads
OL,7,Fwere closed earlier after an electrical
OL,8,Ffault.
OL,10,FPolice and fire teams were called to
OL,11,FSilver Street in Bradford on Avon,
OL,12,FWiltshire, at 11:02 BST to reports of a
OL,13,Fsuspected gas leak.
OL,15,FPeople were urged to avoid the area as
OL,16,FTown Bridge, Market Street, Silver
OL,17,FStreet and St Margaret's Street were
OL,18,Fcordoned off.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
