OL,3,GNEWSAShops evacuated after potential
OL,4,Agas leak reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wiltshire Police spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"It is believed the incident was caused
OL,8,Fby an electrical fault, and the area
OL,9,Fwas made safe. All road closures were
OL,10,Flifted at around 14:00 BST."
